Try Wikihack, the NetHack wiki: http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Main_Page
When a new article is created, the editors will try to add articles for
all possible sounds associated with the new topic and redirect them
there. Then you can just type the sound you just heard and be
redirected to its cause, as is explained here:
http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Sounds

The wiki isn't extensive in that matter yet, since we still lack some
critical articles such as 'treasure zoo', and redirecting anything into
a non-existent article is considered a bad habit. However, when you
type the sound, you will at least find the source code file responsible
for that sound. Then you will possibly be able to identify the cause of
the sound by reading the source. Mind you, Wikihack includes the
complete source of a few versions of NetHack. :)

